### 6. $f(x) = \frac{x}{|x|}$

* **Dominio:** $x \in \mathbb{R} \mid x \neq 0$
* **Rango:** $\{-1, 1\}$ (Es 1 si $x > 0$, y -1 si $x < 0$)

::: {layout-ncol=2 style="display: flex; align-items: center;"}

```{r}
#| echo: false
#| message: false
#| warning: false
x_vals <- -3:3
y_vals <- x_vals / abs(x_vals)
y_vals[is.nan(y_vals)] <- "Indefinido"
df_tbl <- data.frame(x = x_vals, `f(x)` = y_vals, check.names = FALSE)

kable(df_tbl, align = "c") %>%
  kable_styling(bootstrap_options = c("striped", "hover", "condensed"), full_width = FALSE) %>%
  row_spec(4, bold = TRUE, color = "white", background = "#E74C3C")
```

```{r}
#| echo: false
#| message: false
#| warning: false
x_hc <- seq(-5, 5, by = 0.05)
y_hc <- x_hc / abs(x_hc)
y_hc[abs(x_hc) < 0.1] <- NA # Romper línea en el salto
df_hc <- data.frame(x = round(x_hc, 2), y = round(y_hc, 2))

hchart(df_hc, "line", hcaes(x = x, y = y), color = "#2C3E50", name = "f(x)") %>%
  hc_xAxis(title = list(text = "x"), crosshair = TRUE) %>%
  hc_yAxis(title = list(text = "f(x)"), min = -2, max = 2) %>%
  hc_tooltip(pointFormat = "<b>f(x):</b> {point.y}")
```
:::

### 7. $f(x) = \frac{2x}{x^2 - 9}$

* **Dominio:** El denominador se hace cero cuando $x^2 - 9 = 0$, es decir, en $x = 3$ y $x = -3$. 
  * $D_f = \mathbb{R} \setminus \{-3, 3\}$ o $(-\infty, -3) \cup (-3, 3) \cup (3, \infty)$
* **Rango:** La función cruza el eje horizontal y cubre todos los valores reales.
  * $R_f = \mathbb{R}$

::: {layout-ncol=2 style="display: flex; align-items: center;"}

```{r}
#| echo: false
#| message: false
#| warning: false
x_vals <- -5:5
y_vals <- suppressWarnings(2 * x_vals / (x_vals^2 - 9))
y_vals <- ifelse(is.infinite(y_vals), "Indefinido", round(y_vals, 2))
df_tbl <- data.frame(x = x_vals, `f(x)` = y_vals, check.names = FALSE)

kable(df_tbl, align = "c") %>%
  kable_styling(bootstrap_options = c("striped", "hover", "condensed"), full_width = FALSE) %>%
  row_spec(c(3, 9), bold = TRUE, color = "white", background = "#E74C3C")
```

```{r}
#| echo: false
#| message: false
#| warning: false
x_hc <- seq(-8, 8, by = 0.05)
y_hc <- (2 * x_hc) / (x_hc^2 - 9)
# Cortar la línea en las asíntotas
y_hc[abs(x_hc - 3) < 0.1 | abs(x_hc + 3) < 0.1] <- NA 
df_hc <- data.frame(x = round(x_hc, 2), y = round(y_hc, 2))

hchart(df_hc, "line", hcaes(x = x, y = y), color = "#C0392B", name = "f(x)") %>%
  hc_xAxis(title = list(text = "x"), crosshair = TRUE) %>%
  hc_yAxis(title = list(text = "f(x)"), min = -10, max = 10) %>%
  hc_tooltip(pointFormat = "<b>f(x):</b> {point.y}")
```
:::

