### 8. $f(x) = \sqrt{x^2 - 4}$

* **Dominio:** $x^2 - 4 \ge 0 \implies (x-2)(x+2) \ge 0$. Esto ocurre en los extremos exteriores de las raíces.
  * $D_f = (-\infty, -2] \cup [2, \infty)$
* **Rango:** Como es una raíz principal par, sus valores son no negativos.
  * $R_f = [0, \infty)$

::: {layout-ncol=2 style="display: flex; align-items: center;"}

```{r}
#| echo: false
#| message: false
#| warning: false
x_vals <- -4:4
y_vals <- suppressWarnings(sqrt(x_vals^2 - 4))
y_vals <- ifelse(is.nan(y_vals), "No Real", round(y_vals, 2))
df_tbl <- data.frame(x = x_vals, `f(x)` = y_vals, check.names = FALSE)

kable(df_tbl, align = "c") %>%
  kable_styling(bootstrap_options = c("striped", "hover", "condensed"), full_width = FALSE) %>%
  row_spec(4:6, color = "#7F8C8D", italic = TRUE)
```

```{r}
#| echo: false
#| message: false
#| warning: false
x_hc <- seq(-6, 6, by = 0.05)
y_hc <- sqrt(x_hc^2 - 4)
y_hc[x_hc > -2 & x_hc < 2] <- NA 
df_hc <- data.frame(x = round(x_hc, 2), y = round(y_hc, 2))

hchart(df_hc, "line", hcaes(x = x, y = y), color = "#D35400", name = "f(x)") %>%
  hc_plotOptions(line = list(lineWidth = 3)) %>% # <--- Línea agregada
  hc_xAxis(title = list(text = "x"), crosshair = TRUE) %>%
  hc_yAxis(title = list(text = "f(x)"), min = 0, max = 6) %>%
  hc_tooltip(pointFormat = "<b>f(x):</b> {point.y}")
```
:::

